1. An autofocus sensor comprising:  
a microlens array including a plurality of microlenses arranged two-dimensionally;  
a photodetector array including a plurality of photodetectors corresponding to the plurality of microlenses and configured to receive light passed through the microlenses and generate image signals;  
a focus detection unit configured to detect a defocus amount using the image signals generated by the photodetector array; and  
a recognition unit configured to recognize at least one image characteristic of an object image represented by the image signals and to select, based on the recognized at least one image characteristic, one defocus detection method from among a plurality of different defocus detection methods,  
wherein the focus detection unit detects the defocus amount by applying the defocus detection method selected by the recognition unit.
